VskykEQqycm5LHlTHWfHuf1TF1mX07fY6fjSN5c4R\"/><div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0 justify-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"><span class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface tracking-tight truncate\">Padel Assist</span><span class=\"font-label-tag text-label-tag px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary tracking-wider uppercase shrink-0\">Pro</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-primary opacity-75\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-primary\"></span></span><span class=\"font-label-tag text-label-tag text-on-surface-variant truncate\">Abierto hoy hasta 11:00 PM</span></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm shrink-0\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Canchas</span><button class=\"relative p-1 rounded-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] flex items-center justify-center transition-transform active:scale-95\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Profile\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(78,222,163,0.35)]\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAoQl5X_m2cV9bRK7RlnPofFbj31grok4OcvQMhxbj97bNO-T2O68G0UZrYP-AHwkLyL_fRO58jKMvAQ0xbn2TLcGTR1muCm7QhwfiL9M-HbviGaxeqFFYUGi_4-ZzPgIpibfrIIyUgfq2Z_97lo08PoZP32Kve65N4-Fxeh7KILLPamE6jxXT_3Y4HCfNUKZTZ-YuhHB0HZG526gv9NW02LJPREO7WsPBJBoTgvbhlf3Oj7QZyyy9R\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></span></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col relative w-full px-margin pt-16 pb-28 bg-surface\"><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full gap-space-lg\">\n<!-- Saludo & Status Header -->\n<section class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs mt-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n<h1 class=\"font-headline-lg-mobile text-headline-lg-mobile text-on-surface tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\">\n          \302\241Hola, Mart\303\255n! <span class=\"inline-block hover:rotate-12 transition-transform cursor-default\">\360\237\221\213</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">Encuentra tu pista hoy</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high shadow-md\">\n<span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n<span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-primary opacity-75\"></span>\n<span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-primary\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-tag text-label-tag text-primary tracking-wider uppercase\">Sede Norte</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Banner Din\303\241mico: Matchmaking / 4to Jugador -->\n<aside class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high shadow-xl p-space-md\">\n<div class=\"absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-2xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-space-sm relative z-10\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm text-primary\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-variation-settings: \'FILL\' 1;\">group_add</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n<span class=\"font-label-tag text-label-tag px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary/15 text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">\n            Match Abierto\n          </span>\n<span class=\"font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\342\200\242 20:00 hs</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface font-semibold leading-snug\">\n          \302\277Buscas rival o 4to jugador?\n        </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">\n          Falta 1 jugador de Categor\303\255a 5\302\252 en Cancha Central. \302\241\303\232nete en un tap!\n        </p>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-3 pt-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center -space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-label-tag text-label-tag font-bold\">FR</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface font-label-tag text-label-tag\">AL</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-variant text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag\">MC</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-bright text-primary font-label-tag text-label-tag\">+1</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-tag text-label-tag font-bold active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-md flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\">\n<span>Sumarme</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<!-- Filtro R\303\241pido con Chips Horizontales -->\n<section class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-label-tag text-label-tag uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant\">Tipo de Cancha</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-primary\">3 disponibles</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs overflow-x-auto pb-1 -mx-margin px-margin scrollbar-none\" id=\"filter-chips\">\n<button class=\"chip active shrink-0 px-space-md py-2 rounded-full font-label-tag text-label-tag transition-all duration-200 bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-sm\" data-category=\"all\" type=\"button\">\n        Todas (3)\n      </button>\n<button class=\"chip shrink-0 px-space-md py-2 rounded-full font-label-tag text-label-tag transition-all duration-200 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface active:scale-95\" data-category=\"panoramica\" type=\"button\">\n        Panor\303\241mica Pro\n      </button>\n<button class=\"chip shrink-0 px-space-md py-2 rounded-full font-label-tag text-label-tag transition-all duration-200 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface active:scale-95\" data-category=\"techada\" type=\"button\">\n        Cristal Techada\n      </button>\n<button class=\"chip shrink-0 px-space-md py-2 rounded-full font-label-tag text-label-tag transition-all duration-200 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface active:scale-95\" data-category=\"exterior\" type=\"button\">\n        Pista Exterior\n      </button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Listado de Pistas (Court Cards) -->\n<section class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-lg\" id=\"courts-container\">\n<!-- TARJETA 1: Pista Central Panor\303\241mica -->\n<article class=\"court-card group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-surface-container overflow-hidden shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\" data-type=\"panoramica\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-44 overflow-hidden\">\n<img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" data-alt=\"High-end professional indoor padel court panoramic glass walls glowing led illumination deep dark moody atmosphere emerald blue turf vivid colors crisp sports photography\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBpdWVwxteW1lne-q0LehSbx0IbRB0yRQ0gEpfhh0AfCyPZG60ejG6UZb6efs-u_mWVE0Hq-AKsC-5_EzHequQwJSz9ZvZz4umAmYfqiyd0D8R1uF4JNs97gDOJ3N4ISdCSmOwlD4jDThfflcwqJh8wmCOOKKgAzPf6EQ5rXtFUnYXuTShLIguloUMbOQpak6uWLwudTx7U0Ca4RGrvHJGA990TTEjDVpMNj50e7QUcq8Cdj5gZkTGB\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface-container via-surface-container/30 to-transparent\"></div>\n<!-- Badges Superiores -->\n<div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-primary font-label-tag text-label-tag shadow-md flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">star</span>\n            Panor\303\241mica Pro\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/80 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm\">\n            Pista 1\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- Precio Pill -->\n<div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-numeric-md text-label-numeric-md shadow-lg flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">$28</span>\n<span class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag font-normal\">/ 90m</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Indicador de Disponibilidad Inmediata -->\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-3 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/20 backdrop-blur-md\">\n<span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse\"></span>\n<span class=\"font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-primary font-bold\">3 turnos libres hoy</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Contenido Card -->\n<div class=\"p-space-md flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface tracking-tight\">Pista Central Panor\303\241mica</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">Torneos oficiales y juego de alta competencia</p>\n</div>\n<button aria-label=\"Guardar pista en favoritos\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error active:scale-90 transition-colors\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">favorite</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- Tags de Especificaciones -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 my-1\">\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-tertiary\">layers</span>\n            C\303\251sped WPT Blue\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary\">lightbulb</span>\n            LED 8x Pro 500 Lux\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-secondary\">shield</span>\n            Cristal 12mm\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- Horarios R\303\241pidos de muestra -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-1\">\n<div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-center\">\n<span class=\"block font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-primary font-bold\">17:00</span>\n<span class=\"block font-label-tag text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant\">Disponible</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-center\">\n<span class=\"block font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-primary font-bold\">18:30</span>\n<span class=\"block font-label-tag text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant\">Disponible</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-center opacity-40\">\n<span class=\"block font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-on-surface-variant line-through\">20:00</span>\n<span class=\"block font-label-tag text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant\">Ocupado</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- CTA Principal -->\n<button class=\"relative overflow-hidden w-full mt-2 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary text-on-primary font-headline-md text-[15px] font-bold tracking-wide active:scale-[0.98] transition-transform shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group/btn\" type=\"button\">\n<span>Ver Disponibilidad</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">calendar_month</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- TARJETA 2: Pista Techada Indoor 2 -->\n<article class=\"court-card group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-surface-container overflow-hidden shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\" data-type=\"techada\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-44 overflow-hidden\">\n<img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" data-alt=\"Covered indoor padel club court high ceilings metallic structure emerald green synthetic grass atmospheric soft spotlights modern sports venue\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDrbGNhB6aWR6j-BIbwvQH1F8GUhAUz8EEXtqkxQDC7U1p8mZWg8pP93O_XXspeQEOPtjaTtXr-gueV0jZoj65OC8DHs6scWzxSEU5RVlIQ8VIUmWR8LwS8IwNmKymvx6jdkKBWZhbS_ml9AZ-101V4lUT0JYxIuYfl7Wcr5F6KpxHukWgZ6dTWWuWvGWl4mJ2NIOMCkxbvZ_RI6KFYZSn8qsZDpnh9QBfhbIC6h7BYcw1WnfUq0eOF\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface-container via-surface-container/30 to-transparent\"></div>\n<!-- Badges Superiores -->\n<div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-secondary font-label-tag text-label-tag shadow-md flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">roofing</span>\n            Techada Cubierta\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/80 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm\">\n            Pista 2\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- Precio Pill -->\n<div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-numeric-md text-label-numeric-md shadow-lg flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">$24</span>\n<span class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag font-normal\">/ 90m</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Indicador de Disponibilidad Inmediata -->\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-3 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 backdrop-blur-md\">\n<span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse\"></span>\n<span class=\"font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-secondary font-bold\">Turno estelar 19:30 libre</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Contenido Card -->\n<div class=\"p-space-md flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface tracking-tight\">Pista Techada Indoor 2</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">Protecci\303\263n total contra clima y rebote controlado</p>\n</div>\n<button aria-label=\"Guardar pista en favoritos\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error active:scale-90 transition-colors\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">favorite</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- Tags de Especificaciones -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 my-1\">\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary\">eco</span>\n            C\303\251sped Texturizado Verde\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-tertiary\">ac_unit</span>\n            Climatizada Anti-lluvia\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-secondary\">volume_down</span>\n            Insonorizada\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- CTA Principal -->\n<button class=\"relative overflow-hidden w-full mt-2 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest hover:bg-surface-bright text-primary font-headline-md text-[15px] font-bold tracking-wide active:scale-[0.98] transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" type=\"button\">\n<span>Ver Disponibilidad</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">schedule</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- TARJETA 3: Pista Open Air 3 -->\n<article class=\"court-card group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-surface-container overflow-hidden shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\" data-type=\"exterior\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-44 overflow-hidden\">\n<img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" data-alt=\"Outdoor padel court under sunset blue twilight sky modern artificial lights glass enclosure surrounding palm trees luxury sports club\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCSb512bav7YVwR-NxW4KAYnX6i7mkcLGAstZlhnZtoo4ghAxLY-nlal9Zu-yhujQKeRrHOuRkCVQ23X1L-pyTwsJOGu9JMMQz01uEyxeCeWOikEoBz9axq1s9RgvJl-kBKEVaqVap9h0BWPvs_4q1b513POJm_svxXnMoB7_LYGwM-WrpFv8cj8HZ5s9T8XqUVaBOI8ovSenbFRyE4Hz5Gftg6q7AqqGBCGLZxTZ4rEQmYyh8mfaCV\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface-container via-surface-container/30 to-transparent\"></div>\n<!-- Badges Superiores -->\n<div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-tertiary font-label-tag text-label-tag shadow-md flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">wb_sunny</span>\n            Pista Exterior\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/80 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm\">\n            Pista 3\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- Precio Pill -->\n<div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-numeric-md text-label-numeric-md shadow-lg flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"text-tertiary font-bold\">$20</span>\n<span class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag font-normal\">/ 90m</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Indicador de Disponibilidad Inmediata -->\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-2.5 left-3 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/80 backdrop-blur-md\">\n<span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary\"></span>\n<span class=\"font-label-numeric-sm text-label-numeric-sm text-on-surface\">Disponible desde 21:00</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Contenido Card -->\n<div class=\"p-space-md flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface tracking-tight\">Pista Open Air 3</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">Aire fresco y visibilidad \303\263ptima en turnos nocturnos</p>\n</div>\n<button aria-label=\"Guardar pista en favoritos\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error active:scale-90 transition-colors\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">favorite</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- Tags de Especificaciones -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 my-1\">\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-tertiary\">speed</span>\n            Fibrilado R\303\241pido\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary\">nights_stay</span>\n            Iluminaci\303\263n Nocturna\n          </span>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-tag text-label-tag flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-secondary\">wind_power</span>\n            Ventilaci\303\263n Natural\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- CTA Principal -->\n<button class=\"relative overflow-hidden w-full mt-2 py-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest hover:bg-surface-bright text-tertiary font-headline-md text-[15px] font-bold tracking-wide active:scale-[0.98] transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" type=\"button\">\n<span>Ver Disponibilidad</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">schedule</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n</section>\n<!-- Quick Match Bottom Drawer Trigger (Delight element) -->\n<div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low p-space-md flex items-center justify-between shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">bolt</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\">Reserva Rel\303\241mpago</p>\n<p class=\"font-label-tag text-label-tag text-on-surface-variant\">Asignar mejor pista y turno disponible</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high hover:bg-surface-container-highest text-primary font-label-tag text-label-tag font-bold transition-transform active:scale-95 shadow-sm\" type=\"button\">\n      Auto-Slot\n    </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  // Filter chips micro-interaction\n  document.querySelectorAll(\'#filter-chips .chip\').forEach(button => {\n    button.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\n      // Toggle button states\n      document.querySelectorAll(\'#filter-chips .chip\').forEach(btn => {\n        btn.classList.remove(\'bg-primary\', \'text-on-primary\', \'shadow-sm\');\n        btn.classList.add(\'bg-surface-container\', \'text-on-surface-variant\');\n      });\n      button.classList.remove(\'bg-surface-container\', \'text-on-surface-variant\');\n      button.classList.add(\'bg-primary\', \'text-on-primary\', \'shadow-sm\');\n\n      // Filter court cards\n      const category = button.getAttribute(\'data-category\');\n      const cards = document.querySelectorAll(\'#courts-container .court-card\');\n\n      cards.forEach(card => {\n        if (category === \'all\' || card.getAttribute(\'data-type\') === category) {\n          card.style.display = \'flex\';\n          card.style.opacity = \'0\';\n          setTimeout(() => {\n            card.style.opacity = \'1\';\n          }, 50);\n        } else {\n          card.style.display = \'none\';\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Favorite button toggle micro-interaction\n  document.querySelectorAll(\'button[aria-label=\"Guardar pista en favoritos\"]\').forEach(favBtn => {\n    favBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', (e) => {\n      e.stopPropagation();\n      const icon = favBtn.querySelector(\'.material-symbols-outlined\');\n      if (icon.textContent === \'favorite\') {\n        icon.textContent = \'favorite\';\n        icon.style.fontVariationSettings = icon.style.fontVariationSettings ? \'\' : \"\'FILL\' 1\";\n        favBtn.classList.toggle(\'text-error\');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script></main><nav class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 z-50 pb-safe bg-surface-container-lowest/85 backdrop-blur-2xl shadow-[0_-8px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]\" data-active-classes=\"text-primary font-semibold [&amp;_.active-pill]: