  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing CSS Styles**\n\nI\'m currently focused on dissecting the `src/index.css` file. I\'m taking a close look at how custom theme colors and utilities might be defined in the context of Tailwind CSS v4, specifically through the use of `@theme`. I\'m starting to visualize how these definitions could influence the overall styling.\n\n\n**Defining Color Variables**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the specific color variables defined, particularly within the `--color-*` namespace. I\'m noting the hierarchical structure, such as `--color-surface-*`, `--color-primary-*`, etc. It\'s becoming clear that these act as the foundation for the application\'s visual theme. I need to understand how these vars are integrated into the broader styling rules.\n\n\n**Examining New Definitions**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the definitions of various styles, noting the specific color values like `--color-on-surface-variant` and `--color-error-container`. Additionally, I am focusing on the font styles and their application with the different `--font-*` variables. Furthermore, I am noting the different space and margin definitions. I\'m starting to understand how they will be styled in HTML.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_271674"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --color-surface: #0f131c;\\n  --color-surface-dim: #0f131c;\\n  --color-surface-bright: #353943;\\n  --color-surface-variant: #31353f;\\n  --color-surface-container-lowest: #0a0e17;\\n  --color-surface-container-low: #181b25;\\n  --color-surface-container: #1c1f29;\\n  --color-surface-container-high: #262a34;\\n  --color-surface-container-highest: #31353f;\\n\\n  --color-primary: #4edea3;\\n  --color-primary-container: #10b981;\\n  --color-primary-fixed: #6ffbbe;\\n  --color-primary-fixed-dim: #4edea3;\\n  --color-on-primary: #003824;\\n  --color-on-primary-container: #00422b;\\n  --color-on-primary-fixed: #002113;\\n\\n  --color-secondary: #45dfa4;\\n  --color-secondary-container: #00bd85;\\n  --color-secondary-fixed: #68fcbf;\\n  --color-secondary-fixed-dim: #45dfa4;\\n  --color-on-secondary: #003825;\\n  --color-on-secondary-container: #00452e;\\n\\n  --color-tertiary: #7bd0ff;\\n  --color-tertiary-container: #19aee8;\\n  --color-tertiary-fixed: #c4e7ff;\\n  --color-tertiary-fixed-dim: #7bd0ff;\\n  --color-on-tertiary: #00354a;\\n  --color-on-tertiary-container: #003e55;\\n\\n  --color-on-surface: #dfe2ef;\\n  --color-on-surface-variant: #bbcabf;\\n  --color-outline: #86948a;\\n  --color-outline-variant: #3c4a42;\\n\\n  --color-error: #ffb4ab;\\n  --color-error-container: #93000a;\\n  --color-on-error: #690005;\\n  --color-on-error-container: #ffdad6;\\n\\n  --font-headline-xl: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-headline-lg: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-headline-lg-mobile: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-headline-md: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-body-lg: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-body-md: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-body-sm: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-label-tag: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", sans-serif;\\n  --font-label-numeric-lg: \\\"S