  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Type Specifications**\n\nI\'m currently working on defining the types required for the project in `src/types.ts`. I\'ve begun by analyzing the SQL schema and incorporating the user prompt\'s instructions. Specifically, I\'ve established the `user_role` type, and started setting up the `profiles` type. I am looking into how best to represent these types in TypeScript.\n\n\n**Expanding Type Definitions**\n\nI\'ve been fleshing out more types. The `courts`, `amenities_catalog`, `booking_status`, and especially the complex `bookings` type have occupied my thoughts. I am currently considering the best way to represent the different data formats like the `start_time` and `end_time` strings and how to best use the options for representing these date and time elements. I\'m also ensuring the types reflect the relationships between the data in the SQL schema.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_592524"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * Types and interfaces for Padel Assist Pro\\n * Matches the PostgreSQL schema and frontend components\\n */\\n\\nexport type UserRole = \'customer\' | \'club_admin\' | \'superadmin\';\\n\\nexport interface UserProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  full_name: string;\\n  phone: string;\\n  avatar_url?: string;\\n  role: UserRole;\\n  category?: string;\\n  initials?: string;\\n  created_at?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type CourtFilterType = \'all\' | \'panoramica\' | \'techada\' | \'exterior\';\\n\\nexport interface CourtSpec {\\n  icon: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  colorClass?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface QuickSlot {\\n  time: string;\\n  available: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Court {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  type: string;\\n  category: \'panoramica\' | \'techada\' | \'exterior\';\\n  court_number_label: string;\\n  is_active: boolean;\\n  hourly_rate: number;\\n  rate_for_90m: number;\\n  photos: string[];\\n  description: string;\\n  specs: CourtSpec[];\\n  quick_slots: QuickSlot[];\\n  banner_badge: string;\\n  banner_color: string;\\n  instant_badge: string;\\n  is_favorite?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Amenity {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  category: \'alquiler\' | \'tienda\' | \'servicio_gratis\';\\n  price: number;\\n  is_available: boolean;\\n  image_url?: string;\\n  subtitle?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type BookingStatus = \'pending_payment\' | \'confirmed\' | \'cancelled\' | \'completed\';\\n\\nexport interface PlayerSlot {\\n  name: string;\\n  avatar?: string;\\n  initials?: string;\\n  is_captain?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Booking {\\n  id: string;\\n  court_id: string;\\n  court_name: string;\\n  court_type: string;\\n  court_image: string;\\n  court_badge?: string;\\n  user_id: string;\\n  user_name: string;\\n  guest_name?: string;\\n  guest_phone?: string;\\n  start_time: string;\\n  end_time: string;\\n  date_label: string;\\n  date_full: string;\\n  duration_min: number;\\n  court_price: number;\\n  lighting_price: number;\\n  total_price: number;\\n  status: BookingStatus;\\n  payment_proof_url?: string;\\n  payment_method?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  players: PlayerSlot[];\\n  max_players: number;\\n  location_label: string;\\n  countdown_text?: string;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TimeSlot {\\n  id: string;\\n  time_range: string;\\n  start_hour: string;\\n  period: \'morning\' | \'afternoon\' | \'night\';\\n  price: number;\\n  label?: string;\\n  status: \'available\' | \'booked\' | \'in_game\' | \'selected\' | \'blocked\';\\n  is_last?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport type NavView = \'canchas\' | \'reservar\' | \'mis-partidos\' | \'club-info\';\\n\\nexport interface ToastMessage {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  type?: \'success\' | \'info\' | \'error\';\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create central types in src/types.ts\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing types.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create central types definition\"}"
