  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Centralizing Business Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the user\'s explicit instructions, meticulously moving all business logic into `src/apiService.ts`. This involves refactoring functions like `updateUserProfileInDb` and `resetUserProfileInDb` to reside exclusively within this dedicated file, ensuring clean separation of concerns for Firebase interactions and the Gemini API. This compartmentalization is crucial for maintainability and scalability.\n\n\n**Expanding API Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating new functionalities within `apiService.ts`. I\'m focusing on user management tasks such as `loginAsAdmin` and `handlePasswordReset`, and the generation of AI routines. I\'m also including methods like `fetchCourts` and `createBooking`. I\'m also preparing for Gemini API integration, using `@google/genai`, and verifying the environment configurations for API key handling. I\'m ensuring robust error handling in case the API key is unavailable. I will be working on mocks for this new functionality.\n\n\n**Populating Initial Data**\n\nI\'ve populated `src/apiService.ts` with initial data matching the exact user interface specifications. I\'ve input user profiles, including details like Mart\303\255n G\303\263mez and his contact information, role, avatar, and initials. Also, I added court information, like the \"Pista Central Panor\303\241mica,\" including its category, number label, hourly rate, and banner details, along with corresponding photos.\n\n\n**Adding Court Details**\n\nI\'ve added detailed information for Courts 1, 2, and 3 to `src/apiService.ts`. I included all specified attributes: names, categories, labels, rates (hourly and 90m), banner details, and photo URLs. I also incorporated specifications like surface type and lighting for each court, as well as slot availability. This structured approach ensures accurate data representation for court bookings.\n\n\n**Adding Booking Details**\n\nI\'ve just added detailed data for \"Pista 3\" including hourly and 90-minute rates, banner details, and photos. I\'ve also incorporated specific court specifications like surface type and lighting. Following this, I populated it with quick slot availability. Additionally, I\'ve added a booking entry with an ID, associated court details, and an image URL. It\'s a \"Pending Payment\" booking, featuring a \"Hero Match Card\" description.\n\n\n**Adding Booking Details**\n\nI\'ve just added a new booking entry with detailed data for \"Pista de Cristal\" including start and end times, duration, date label, and a countdown. I\'ve also incorporated total and court prices, status, notes, location, and list of players, and a separate confirmed and paid booking with associated court details.\n\n\n\n**Adding Booking Details**\n\nI\'ve just added a new booking entry for Friday, October 17th, with confirmed status and player details. I\'ve populated the necessary fields including start and end times, duration, price, status, location, and a list of two players with their captain and profile image URLs.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_434201"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * API & Data Service for Padel Assist Pro\\n * Centralized business logic, state mutations, and external API interactions\\n */\\nimport { Court, Amenity, Booking, UserProfile, TimeSlot } from \'./types\';\\n\\nconst INITIAL_PROFILE: UserProfile = {\\n  id: \'usr-martin-001\',\\n  full_name: \'Mart\303\255n G\303\263mez\',\\n  phone: \'+54 9 11 4455-8899\',\\n  avatar_url:\\n    \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAoQl5X_m2cV9bRK7RlnPofFbj31grok4OcvQMhxbj97bNO-T2O68G0UZrYP-AHwkLyL_fRO58jKMvAQ0xbn2TLcGTR1muCm7QhwfiL9M-HbviGaxeqFFYUGi_4-ZzPgIpibfrIIyUgfq2Z_97lo08PoZP32Kve65N4-Fxeh7KILLPamE6jxXT_3Y4HCfNUKZTZ-YuhHB0HZG526gv9NW02LJPREO7WsPBJBoTgvbhlf3Oj7QZyyy9R\',\\n  role: \'customer\',\\n  category: \'5\302\252 Categor\303\255a\',\\n  initials: \'MG\',\\n  created_at: new Date().toISOString(),\\n};\\n\\nconst INITIAL_COURTS: Court[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'court-1\',\\n    name: \'Pista Central Panor\303\241mica\',\\n    type: \'Panor\303\241mica Pro\',\\n    category: \'panoramica\',\\n    court_number_label: \'Pista 1\',\\n    is_active: true,\\n    hourly_rate: 20,\\n    rate_for_90m: 28,\\n    photos: [\\n      \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBpdWVwxteW1lne-q0LehSbx0IbRB0yRQ0gEpfhh0AfCyPZG60ejG6UZb6efs-u_mWVE0Hq-AKsC-5_EzHequQwJSz9ZvZz4umAmYfqiyd0D8R1uF4JNs97gDOJ3N4ISdCSmOwlD4jDThfflcwqJh8wmCOOKKgAzPf6EQ5rXtFUnYXuTShLIguloUMbOQpak6uWLwudTx7U0Ca4RGrvHJGA990TTEjDVpMNj50e7QUcq8Cdj5gZkTGB\',\\n    ],\\n    description: \'Torneos oficiales y juego de alta competencia con paredes panor\303\241micas de cristal templado.\',\\n    banner_badge: \'Panor\303\241mica Pro\',\\n    banner_color: \'text-primary\',\\n    instant_badge: \'3 turnos libres hoy\',\\n    is_favorite: false,\\n    specs: [\\n      { icon: \'layers\', label: \'C\303\251sped WPT Blue\', colorClass: \'text-tertiary\' },\\n      { icon: \'lightbulb\', label: \'LED 8x Pro 500 Lux\', colorClass: \'text-primary\' },\\n      { icon: \'shield\', label: \'Cristal 12mm\', colorClass: \'text-secondary\' },\\n    ],\\n    quick_slots: [\\n      { time: \'17:00\', available: true },\\n      { time: \'18:30\', available: true },\\n      { time: \'20:00\', available: false },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'court-2\',\\n    name: \'Pista Techada Indoor 2\',\\n    type: \'Techada Cubierta\',\\n    category: \'techada\',\\n    court_number_label: \'Pista 2\',\\n    is_active: true,\\n    hourly_rate: 18,\\n    rate_for_90m: 24,\\n    photos: [\\n      \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDrbGNhB6aWR6j-BIbwvQH1F8GUhAUz8EEXtqkxQDC7U1p8mZWg8pP93O_XXspeQEOPtjaTtXr-gueV0jZoj65OC8DHs6scWzxSEU5RVlIQ8VIUmWR8LwS8IwNmKymvx6jdkKBWZhbS_ml9AZ-101V4lUT0JYxIuYfl7Wcr5F6KpxHukWgZ6dTWWuWvGWl4mJ2NIOMCkxbvZ_RI6KFYZSn8qsZDpnh9QBfhbIC6h7BYcw1WnfUq0eOF\',\\n    ],\\n    description: \'Protecci\303\263n total contra clima, techo alto estructural y rebote ac\303\272stico amortiguado.\',\\n    banner_badge: \'Techada Cubierta\',\\n    banner_color: \'text-secondary\',\\n    instant_badge: \'Turno estelar 19:30 libre\',\\n    is_favorite: false,\\n    specs: [\\n      { icon: \'eco\', label: \'C\303\251sped Texturizado Verde\', colorClass: \'text-primary\' },\\n      { icon: \'ac_unit\', label: \'Climatizada Anti-lluvia\', colorClass: \'text-tertiary\' },\\n      { icon: \'volume_down\', label: \'Insonorizada\', colorClass: \'text-secondary\' },\\n    ],\\n    quick_slots: [\\n      { time: \'16:30\', available: true },\\n      { time: \'18:00\', available: false },\\n      { time: \'19:30\', available: true },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'court-3\',\\n    name: \'Pista Open Air 3\',\\n    type: \'Pista Exterior\',\\n    category: \'exterior\',\\n    court_number_label: \'Pista 3\',\\n    is_active: true,\\n    hourly_rate: 15,\\n    rate_for_90m: 20,\\n    photos: [\\n      \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCSb512bav7YVwR-NxW4KAYnX6i7mkcLGAstZlhnZtoo4ghAxLY-nlal9Zu-yhujQKeRrHOuRkCVQ23X1L-pyTwsJOGu9JMMQz01uEyxeCeWOikEoBz9axq1s9RgvJl-kBKEVaqVap9h0BWPvs_4q1b513POJm_svxXnMoB7_LYGwM-WrpFv8cj8HZ5s9T8XqUVaBOI8ovSenbFRyE4Hz5Gftg6q7AqqGBCGLZxTZ4rEQmYyh8mfaCV\',\\n    ],\\n    description: \'Aire fresco y visibilidad \303\263ptima en turnos nocturnos rodeado de palmeras y cielo abierto.\',\\n    banner_badge: \'Pista Exterior\',\\n    banner_color: \'text-tertiary\',\\n    instant_badge: \'Disponible desde 21:00\',\\n    is_favorite: false,\\n    specs: [\\n      { icon: \'speed\', label: \'Fibrilado R\303\241pido\', colorClass: \'text-tertiary\' },\\n      { icon: \'nights_stay\', label: \'Iluminaci\303\263n Nocturna\', colorClass: \'text-primary\' },\\n      { icon: \'wind_power\', label: \'Ventilaci\303\263n Natural\', colorClass: \'text-secondary\' },\\n    ],\\n    quick_slots: [\\n      { time: \'18:00\', available: false },\\n      { time: \'19:30\', available: false },\\n      { time: \'21:00\', available: true },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nconst INITIAL_BOOKINGS: Booking[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'bk-hero-001\',\\n    court_id: \'court-1\',\\n    court_name: \'Pista Central Panor\303\241mica\',\\n    court_type: \'Pista Principal\',\\n    court_image:\\n      \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCn-FcUBWiRr8UmPwrTqf7DnGKgSrS5nNw5MHR0LWS_q6OUdI839hbhEqOEvpAQqHrrtWilEpU46IX8p34eNDKhDFRV1slzIqujdm39-M26abt5ZRVbjSLBsbRsejoyGCUh8NLqcz6iXMmlT2EAhSV9oK3J2DDLeFcda_ztkv2mwFa91Fj7Yjyvm0tNYJVlEy5MuKppPfFmBrq9b_sr0yheBnWmG6qDZhEYvZAfmZ7j3i6y2dxxKKV6\',\\n    court_badge: \'Panor\303\241mica Pro\',\\n    user_id: \'usr-martin-001\',\\n    user_name: \'Mart\303\255n G\303\263mez\',\\n    start_time: \'19:30\',\\n    end_time: \'21:00\',\\n    duration_min: 90,\\n    date_label: \'HOY\',\\n    date_full: \'Hoy, 19:30 - 21:00\',\\n    court_price: 24.0,\\n    lighting_price: 4.0,\\n    total_price: 28.0,\\n    status: \'pending_payment\',\\n    payment_method: \'Transferencia directa\',\\n    countdown_text: \'Tu partido empieza en 4h 25m\',\\n    notes: \'Pareja Mart\303\255nez / Gonz\303\241lez\',\\n    location_label: \'Sede Norte \342\200\242 Pista de Cristal\',\\n    players: [\\n      {\\n        name: \'Mart\303\255n G\303\263mez\',\\n        avatar:\\n          \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAoQl5X_m2cV9bRK7RlnPofFbj31grok4OcvQMhxbj97bNO-T2O68G0UZrYP-AHwkLyL_fRO58jKMvAQ0xbn2TLcGTR1muCm7QhwfiL9M-HbviGaxeqFFYUGi_4-ZzPgIpibfrIIyUgfq2Z_97lo08PoZP32Kve65N4-Fxeh7KILLPamE6jxXT_3Y4HCfNUKZTZ-YuhHB0HZG526gv9NW02LJPREO7WsPBJBoTgvbhlf3Oj7QZyyy9R\',\\n        is_captain: true,\\n      },\\n    ],\\n    max_players: 4,\\n    created_at: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'bk-confirmed-002\',\\n    court_id: \'court-2\',\\n    court_name: \'Pista Techada Indoor 2\',\\n    court_type: \'Cristal Techada\',\\n    court_image:\\n      \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDrbGNhB6aWR6j-BIbwvQH1F8GUhAUz8EEXtqkxQDC7U1p8mZWg8pP93O_XXspeQEOPtjaTtXr-gueV0jZoj65OC8DHs6scWzxSEU5RVlIQ8VIUmWR8LwS8IwNmKymvx6jdkKBWZhbS_ml9AZ-101V4lUT0JYxIuYfl7Wcr5F6KpxHukWgZ6dTWWuWvGWl4mJ2NIOMCkxbvZ_RI6KFYZSn8qsZDpnh9QBfhbIC6h7BYcw1WnfUq0eOF\',\\n    court_badge: \'Techada Cubierta\',\\n    user_id: \'usr-martin-001\',\\n    user_name: \'Mart\303\255n G\303\263mez\',\\n    start_time: \'18:00\',\\n    end_time: \'19:00\',\\n    duration_min: 60,\\n    date_label: \'Viernes 17 Oct\',\\n    date_full: \'Viernes 17 Oct - 18:00 (60 min)\',\\n    court_price: 24.0,\\n    lighting_price: 0,\\n    total_price: 24.0,\\n    status: \'confirmed\',\\n    payment_method: \'MercadoPago / Tarjeta\',\\n    location_label: \'Sede Norte \342\200\242 Pista de Cristal\',\\n    players: [\\n      {\\n        name: \'Lucas S.\',\\n        avatar:\\n          \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAcTNpVmY5NswhPdvwZRtiv1UKz54_Jw6BjrJuGQyFZd8Q6gs72EQhXqBLInbYuPxB8KCgn4iNJEm83NRHcCNwTxQazMPt_7vi5kS_KC40drCrUxgYRjCf9rsDHF1z89N14zsBvGW6fSyG8vskgyU_KoncUugYeOU8iaJB8twEarOwP0bOBYUwlEaeU6qOfovUpaOTBMy1rsJDrNmYwhcLswj6jHhx2MhQxPUUX0T6Uw1tHmcwRa915\',\\n        is_captain: true,\\n      },\\n      {\\n        name: \'Sof\303\255a M.\',\\n        avatar:\\n          \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCbzCrLZpJcq_itFyNVbVKrn2ou39Ohqxl-Bgig7YFkdtwkkSmf1XfAhnbseuFaT6msIvtFFf9-t1DSBJsFmU90WRcEuGJzhCtIDnzcLVztEL7s55mWNvqIX-GYCAqNY9mNCkfp93-oTjE1QWjEtcuVYF7YvThbqJO9SmiOUyGirey7EHAWK2Gig9MxrQvsdY4NXNgNBPPJ7EZ1poqxIw6X41qnCKQirXZl2hUkKnkNTG-xXFBY7Dw6\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        name: \'Diego R.\',\\n        avatar:\\n          \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDdwN3_m35iby1EBxOpB81Zc_PhQCCBDL4y7y-TZCq7y-bdnHS5UeabwRvDJQC4101ECAMoH6utokS2GS2IPDWLp8PCZlGdVxmaeZRBZM42vLD4v-JWDVoaEy7URbszVfDgqqo-i8NVnrjticS3pR3CAs4a3GcD4BnXlyt3mqrY0qmMljjIMinYfZJXBPoQprbkVo63lRXLKikkNeQv-zaj5dImguCAB-1ZQNufdurrXLQikkjY8T55\',\\n      },\\n    ],\\n    max_players: 4,\\n    created_at: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nconst INITIAL_AMENITIES: Amenity[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'am-1\',\\n    title: \'Pala Bullpadel Pro\',\\n    category: \'alquiler\',\\n    price: 3500,\\n    is_available: true,\\n    subtitle: \'Palas de test Bullpadel y Head con grip nuevo\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'am-2\',\\n    title: \'Tubo de Pelotas Presurizadas\',\\n    category: \'tienda\',\\n    price: 5800,\\n    is_available: true,\\n    subtitle: \'Head Padel Pro S / Bullpadel Gold\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'am-3\',\\n    title: \'Bebidas & Cafeter\303\255a de Especialidad\',\\n    category: \'tienda\',\\n    price: 1800,\\n    is_available: true,\\n    subtitle: \'Gatorade, agua mineral y caf\303\251 espresso\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'am-4\',\\n    title: \'Duchas & Vestuarios Climatizados\',\\n    category: \'servicio_gratis\',\\n    price: 0,\\n    is_available: true,\\n    subtitle: \'Uso libre incluido con tu turno\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\n// Local storage keys for resilience across refresh\\nconst STORAGE_KEY_PROFILE = \'padel_assist_profile_v1\';\\nconst STORAGE_KEY_BOOKINGS = \'padel_assist_bookings_v1\';\\nconst STORAGE_KEY_COURTS = \'padel_assist_courts_v1\';\\n\\nexport function getStoredProfile(): UserProfile {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY_PROFILE);\\n    if (raw) return JSON.parse(raw);\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(\'Error reading stored profile\', e);\\n  }\\n  return INITIAL_PROFILE;\\n}\\n\\nexport function getStoredBookings(): Booking[] {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY_BOOKINGS);\\n    if (raw) return JSON.parse(raw);\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(\'Error reading stored bookings\', e);\\n  }\\n  return INITIAL_BOOKINGS;\\n}\\n\\nexport function getStoredCourts(): Court[] {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY_COURTS);\\n    if (raw) return JSON.parse(raw);\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(\'Error reading stored courts\', e);\\n  }\\n  return INITIAL_COURTS;\\n}\\n\\nexport function saveStoredBookings(bookings: Booking[]): void {\\n  try {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY_BOOKINGS, JSON.stringify(bookings));\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(\'Error saving bookings\', e);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function saveStoredProfile(profile: UserProfile): void {\\n  try {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY_PROFILE, JSON.stringify(profile));\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(\'Error saving profile\', e);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function saveStoredCourts(courts: Court[]): void {\\n  try {\\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY_COURTS, JSON.stringify(courts));\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    console.error(\'Error saving courts\', e);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Required standard business logic functions as specified in user instructions\\n */\\nexport async function updateUserProfileInDb(updatedProfile: Partial<UserProfile>): Promise<UserProfile> {\\n  const current = getStoredProfile();\\n  const nextProfile: UserProfile = { ...current, ...updatedProfile };\\n  saveStoredProfile(nextProfile);\\n  return nextProfile;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function resetUserProfileInDb(): Promise<UserProfile> {\\n  saveStoredProfile(INITIAL_PROFILE);\\n  saveStoredBookings(INITIAL_BOOKINGS);\\n  saveStoredCourts(INITIAL_COURTS);\\n  return INITIAL_PROFILE;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function loginAsAdmin(): Promise<UserProfile> {\\n  const adminProfile: UserProfile = {\\n    id: \'usr-admin-canchero-01\',\\n    full_name: \'Canchero Juan (Turno Tarde)\',\\n    phone: \'+54 9 11 9988-7766\',\\n    avatar_url:\\n      \'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDdwN3_m35iby1EBxOpB81Zc_PhQCCBDL4y7y-TZCq7y-bdnHS5UeabwRvDJQC4101ECAMoH6utokS2GS2IPDWLp8PCZlGdVxmaeZRBZM42vLD4v-JWDVoaEy7URbszVfDgqqo-i8NVnrjticS3pR3CAs4a3GcD4BnXlyt3mqrY0qmMljjIMinYfZJXBPoQprbkVo63lRXLKikkNeQv-zaj5dImguCAB-1ZQNufdurrXLQikkjY8T55\',\\n    role: \'club_admin\',\\n    category: \'Administrador Club\',\\n    initials: \'CJ\',\\n  };\\n  saveStoredProfile(adminProfile);\\n  return adminProfile;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function handlePasswordReset(email: string): Promise<{ success: boolean; message: string }> {\\n  // Simulates Auth password reset\\n  return {\\n    success: true,\\n    message: `Se ha enviado un enlace seguro para restablecer contrase\303\261a a ${email}`,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport async function generateAndAssignAIRoutine(playerCategory: string, courtType: string): Promise<string> {\\n  // Can interact with Gemini API if key exists, or generate high-value athletic strategy\\n  try {\\n    const apiKey = import.meta.env?.VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY || (typeof process !== \'undefined\' && process.env?.GEMINI_API_KEY);\\n    if (apiKey) {\\n      const { GoogleGenAI } = await import(\'@google/genai\');\\n      const ai = new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey });\\n      const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n        model: \'gemini-2.5-flash\',\\n        contents: `Eres el Head Coach de p\303\241del del club. Dise\303\261a una rutina de calentamiento y 2 t\303\241cticas clave para un jugador de ${playerCategory} jugando en pista ${courtType}. Mant\303\251n la respuesta breve (m\303\241ximo 120 palabras), motivadora y estructurada en vi\303\261etas.`,\\n      });\\n      if (response.text) {\\n        return response.text;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.warn(\'Gemini API call skipped or failed, using local pro routine:\', err);\\n  }\\n\\n  return `\360\237\224\245 Rutina Pro (${playerCategory} en ${courtType}):\\\\n\342\200\242 Calentamiento din\303\241mico: 4 min de movilidad articular de hombros y desplazamientos laterales en fondo.\\\\n\342\200\242 T\303\241ctica 1: Aprovecha el rebote controlado en cristal para salir con globo profundo a la esquina descubierta.\\\\n\342\200\242 T\303\241ctica 2: Juega bolas por el centro para generar duda en la pareja contraria y subir r\303\241pido a la red.`;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Court and Booking Business Logic\\n */\\nexport async function createBookingInDb(data: {\\n  court: Court;\\n  dateLabel: string;\\n  dateFull: string;\\n  timeSlot: string;\\n  durationMin: number;\\n  totalPrice: number;\\n  courtPrice: number;\\n  lightingPrice: number;\\n  teamNotes?: string;\\n  user: UserProfile;\\n}): Promise<Booking> {\\n  const bookings = getStoredBookings();\\n  const times = data.timeSlot.split(\' - \');\\n  const startTime = times[0]?.trim() || \'18:00\';\\n  const endTime = times[1]?.trim() || \'19:30\';\\n\\n  const newBooking: Booking = {\\n    id: `bk-${Date.now()}`,\\n    court_id: data.court.id,\\n    court_name: data.court.name,\\n    court_type: data.court.type,\\n    court_image: data.court.photos[0],\\n    court_badge: data.court.banner_badge,\\n    user_id: data.user.id,\\n    user_name: data.user.full_name,\\n    start_time: startTime,\\n    end_time: endTime,\\n    date_label: data.dateLabel,\\n    date_full: data.dateFull,\\n    duration_min: data.durationMin,\\n    court_price: data.courtPrice,\\n    lighting_price: data.lightingPrice,\\n    total_price: data.totalPrice,\\n    status: \'pending_payment\',\\n    payment_method: \'Transferencia directa\',\\n    countdown_text: \'Tu partido est\303\241 programado para hoy\',\\n    notes: data.teamNotes || undefined,\\n    location_label: \'Sede Norte \342\200\242 Pista de Cristal\',\\n    players: [\\n      {\\n        name: data.user.full_name,\\n        avatar: data.user.avatar_url,\\n        is_captain: true,\\n      },\\n    ],\\n    max_players: 4,\\n    created_at: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  };\\n\\n  const updatedBookings = [newBooking, ...bookings];\\n  saveStoredBookings(updatedBookings);\\n  return newBooking;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function cancelBookingInDb(bookingId: string): Promise<Booking[]> {\\n  const bookings = getStoredBookings();\\n  const updated = bookings.map((b) => (b.id === bookingId ? { ...b, status: \'cancelled\' as const } : b));\\n  saveStoredBookings(updated);\\n  return updated;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function uploadPaymentProofInDb(bookingId: string, proofUrl?: string): Promise<Booking[]> {\\n  const bookings = getStoredBookings();\\n  const updated = bookings.map((b) =>\\n    b.id === bookingId\\n      ? {\\n          ...b,\\n          status: \'confirmed\' as const,\\n          payment_proof_url: proofUrl || \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80\',\\n        }\\n      : b\\n  );\\n  saveStoredBookings(updated);\\n  return updated;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function confirmPaymentByCancheroInDb(bookingId: string): Promise<Booking[]> {\\n  const bookings = getStoredBookings();\\n  const updated = bookings.map((b) => (b.id === bookingId ? { ...b, status: \'confirmed\' as const } : b));\\n  saveStoredBookings(updated);\\n  return updated;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function blockCourtSlotInDb(courtId: string, timeSlot: string, reason: string): Promise<{ success: boolean }> {\\n  // Simulate slot blocking in courts\\n  return { success: true };\\n}\\n\\nexport async function joinOpenMatchInDb(user: UserProfile): Promise<{ success: boolean; message: string }> {\\n  return {\\n    success: true,\\n    message: `\302\241Te has sumado al 4to lugar en Cancha Central! Revisa tu pesta\303\261a de Partidos.`,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function getAmenitiesCatalog(): Amenity[] {\\n  return INITIAL_AMENITIES;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create central apiService.ts with all business logic, data storage, and mutations\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/apiService.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing apiService.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create apiService.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\315L\n\312L\001i\024}\023\231\224\255Q\030D\371\250\022\240\030:z%1^\347A\323\1773\361|\315\221\304%\255\317r\364\\\345/\307\257<?\237d\313\360\203\3175\360=\204\324\246\264\b\322\246}G\355P\374\327\351\201\332\371\213\340t\334K\305\265\277\340I\312\2001\\\215+\346\352\345\305\001\236)\254\376\000\332\325\3268QR\203\'\260\317\216\334A\243\320\233\235\267\352\234Cg\243+\rFV\247\331\235\026\030\335\230\026o8iM]\223\226\232\006\326Z\021JV\272\327\230\037\260k\354\377c\314\216\226\306~o\266d\262\366\376\260\324R\215\2522\203\316\273\243\236*\301\347\204\fg\316\272\020\bV\313k\266\215 \332\277j\303\370R\'\330\273\351\304L\023\365K)^\347\000\260-\232f\037\266&\376q3\350\3734OS:\311\223\3646P\232\300kV\270\b\374\324\000-\316\020\222\325\177\003\333h\006Z\004\020\034\\\315\300#\000\276\307\025\032\225v\215|\3444w\357t\226\032\201\374\314\366\232\360\006\234|:\335\231p\265\262\226\271\273\231\306\215$\311i\312\027\313\337\371E\030s\020CB\307Z\347\275\210\254\032\365Nw\312\245\264\022O\272]\344a\223\241\274\231\030;N\324\324\313\273\352\211\220\034L{\364\270\374$\341\337C\002\242(\177y\333\0265e\034\202Y\214Aa\350z\320\347}\262\273n~\004\366\273W\330-$P\n\357hSw2\267*\177\236\276\327\362\275;\346\005.\026\243\241\360^\266\v\2608\001 \223s\376\263\376\251a\352\276\312\316|\250\001\024\274&>2\332q\325.&\254(\211\343mF:\234\255\343HtVj&\003\027\275\2679G\237,\233\226\332\331\337C\323[\254N2\276\274\220RA/\327\236\273\257s\307\271\332\237*\307\252\331\203\325\201\255\3422g\f\327\3153\334\'\267\346w\306\200i\321\377dH\315=,M\317\346\036&\327\316\3626\262.\272\332\337Y\242n\324\261.\005\317\300\310\310\025\233\0251\201\314\330s\314+\245.\357^\371_\303A\356w\237Jb\246\245\244\\\272f\341\n\3635\343\265h\250\374\202O\303\377\261v\321;1gjP\262aAT\305j\023C\375\275\234\212\302\356\341\355\215\024\354{\a\335\244|Q\313\301M-\350\035d\330\252 `n\304\316\177\3118s\250\022ZY\343\370\204%\022\v\032z5m:Z\272\257\230F\343\214\216\364\340Q\252/\a{\367s\311RN\235\2