  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Reusable Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining reusable components. I\'ve decided any interface element used across multiple screens, like a custom button, banner, or card, should be housed in `src/components/`. This approach ensures consistency and maintainability. My next step involves structuring these components logically within the directory.\n\n\n**Structuring Component Interactions**\n\nI\'m now thinking about how to structure component interactions, focusing on small, focused components, as opposed to monolithic screens. I am making sure each component has a clear set of props, enabling clear data flow down from parent to child. The use of events up from child to parent via props passed down has also been specified. I have started listing the components we need to write, starting with AppHeader.\n\n\n**Listing New Components**\n\nI\'ve been busy listing out new components. I\'ve got `BottomNav.tsx` with its active indicators, and a `ToastNotification.tsx` that will be dynamic and self-closing. Also on the list is `MatchmakingBanner.tsx` with its player chips, and a high-end `CourtCard.tsx` with price pills. I\'ve also identified a `QuickMatchDrawer.tsx` for quick reservations and finally `CalendarStrip.tsx` for date selection.\n\n\n**Expanding Component Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing some new components. I\'m focusing on components that enable selection, booking and payment. Specifically, I am defining a `DurationSelector` that selects time durations, and a `TimeSlotGrid` for interactive time selections. Furthermore, a `BookingSummarySheet` is being detailed to confirm bookings. Finally, I need to list a `PaymentDrawer` to integrate payment, a `CancelModal` for cancellation, a `ClubRulesAccordion` for club rules, a `CancheroPanel` for court managers, and a `UserProfileModal`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_730260"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { UserProfile } from \'../types\';\\n\\ninterface AppHeaderProps {\\n  user: UserProfile;\\n  onOpenProfile: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const AppHeader: React.FC<AppHeaderProps> = ({ user, onOpenProfile }) => {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 bg-[#0f131c]/85 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_1px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] pt-safe\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"h-16 px-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 max-w-lg mx-auto\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0 flex-1\\\">\\n          <img\\n            alt=\\\"Padel Assist Logo\\\"\\n            className=\\\"h-8 w-auto object-contain shrink-0\\\"\\n            src=\\\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBTcLzVWuV9Pmp8jS1KFA6igMgateNGc2EVpKfH_x6_XYlpldSMwLVboS0R7F6uudnpJWwy3MecOZ19TEt5olh_alcMGcfFeykSTn0t3B7bYrWB-jioiw4Dc3u_SjW6PlVhGZ0OWB8cMZaqcpv7TEy5QyRXK42tmziASoql8aJUHUu92XqpgzouYa29UnNCICgXKu64b09kJkFVskykEQqycm5LHlTHWfHuf1TF1mX07fY6fjSN5c4R\\\"\\n          />\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col min-w-0 justify-center\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-bold text-[18px] text-[#dfe2ef] tracking-tight truncate\\\">\\n                Padel Assist\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#262a34] text-[#4edea3] tracking-wider uppercase shrink-0\\\">\\n                Pro\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"relative flex h-2 w-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#4edea3] opacity-75\\\"></span>\\n                <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#4edea3]\\\"></span>\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#bbcabf] truncate\\\">\\n                Abierto hoy hasta 11:00 PM\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenProfile}\\n            title={`Perfil de ${user.full_name}`}\\n            aria-label=\\\"Abrir perfil de usuario\\\"\\n            className=\\\"relative p-1 rounded-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#4edea3] min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] flex items-center justify-center transition-transform active:scale-95 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            {user.avatar_url ? (\\n              <img\\n                alt={user.full_name}\\n                className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(78,222,163,0.35)]\\\"\\n                src={user.avatar_url}\\n              />\\n            ) : (\\n              <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#10b981] text-[#00422b] font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-xs\\\">\\n                {user.initials || \'MG\'}\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n            <span className=\\\"absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#4edea3] rounded-full border border-[#0f131c]\\\"></span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create AppHeader component with logo, live status, and user avatar\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AppHeader.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing AppHeader.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create AppHeader component\"}"
