  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Booking Screen Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the Booking Screen component design. First up is `CalendarStrip.tsx`. I\'m envisioning a header for \"Octubre 2024\" alongside a calendar icon, and a \"Semana 42\" badge that subtly pulses. The days will be represented as horizontally scrollable buttons. The first day would read \"Hoy 14 L\", and continue from there.\n\n\n**Defining Booking Screen Elements**\n\nI\'ve moved on to fleshing out the specific components. I am envisioning a `CalendarStrip` with a selected state indicated by emerald highlighting and shadow. I\'m also now designing a `DurationSwitcher` with 60, 90 (recommended), and 120-minute options. The `TimeSlotGrid` will showcase time slots grouped by morning, afternoon, and night, each with pricing and availability indicators. Finally, I\'ve got a first draft of the `BookingSummarySheet` layout, complete with court details, date/time, and a live cost breakdown.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_312911"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\n\\nexport interface CalendarDay {\\n  dayNumber: number;\\n  dayName: string;\\n  isToday: boolean;\\n  statusLabel: string;\\n  statusType: \'available\' | \'low\' | \'high_demand\' | \'full\';\\n  dateStr: string;\\n  fullDateText: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface CalendarStripProps {\\n  selectedDate: string;\\n  onSelectDate: (day: CalendarDay) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CalendarStrip: React.FC<CalendarStripProps> = ({\\n  selectedDate,\\n  onSelectDate,\\n}) => {\\n  const days: CalendarDay[] = [\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 14,\\n      dayName: \'LUN\',\\n      isToday: true,\\n      statusLabel: \'Hoy\',\\n      statusType: \'available\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-14\',\\n      fullDateText: \'Lunes 14 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 15,\\n      dayName: \'MAR\',\\n      isToday: false,\\n      statusLabel: \'Libre\',\\n      statusType: \'available\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-15\',\\n      fullDateText: \'Martes 15 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 16,\\n      dayName: \'MI\303\211\',\\n      isToday: false,\\n      statusLabel: \'Libre\',\\n      statusType: \'available\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-16\',\\n      fullDateText: \'Mi\303\251rcoles 16 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 17,\\n      dayName: \'JUE\',\\n      isToday: false,\\n      statusLabel: \'Pocos\',\\n      statusType: \'low\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-17\',\\n      fullDateText: \'Jueves 17 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 18,\\n      dayName: \'VIE\',\\n      isToday: false,\\n      statusLabel: \'Alta Dem.\',\\n      statusType: \'high_demand\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-18\',\\n      fullDateText: \'Viernes 18 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 19,\\n      dayName: \'S\303\201B\',\\n      isToday: false,\\n      statusLabel: \'Lleno\',\\n      statusType: \'full\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-19\',\\n      fullDateText: \'S\303\241bado 19 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      dayNumber: 20,\\n      dayName: \'DOM\',\\n      isToday: false,\\n      statusLabel: \'Libre\',\\n      statusType: \'available\',\\n      dateStr: \'2024-10-20\',\\n      fullDateText: \'Domingo 20 de Octubre\',\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[#4edea3] text-[20px]\\\">\\n            calendar_month\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[18px] font-bold text-[#dfe2ef]\\\">\\n            Octubre 2024\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n        <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#4edea3] bg-[#262a34] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-[#31353f]\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#4edea3] animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n          Semana 42\\n        </span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Date Strip Slider */}\\n      <div\\n        className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-1 -mx-4 px-4 scrollbar-none\\\"\\n        id=\\\"date-scroller\\\"\\n      >\\n        {days.map((day) => {\\n          const isSelected = selectedDate === day.dateStr;\\n          return (\\n            <button\\n              key={day.dateStr}\\n              onClick={() => onSelectDate(day)}\\n              className={`group flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-w-[64px] py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer ${\\n                isSelected\\n                  ? \'bg-[#10b981] text-[#00422b] shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.35)]\'\\n                  : \'bg-[#262a34] text-[#bbcabf] hover:text-[#dfe2ef] hover:bg-[#353943] border border-[#31353f]/40\'\\n              }`}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span\\n                className={`text-[