 ? \'bg-[#31353f] text-[#4edea3] ring-1 ring-[#4edea3]\'\n              : \'bg-[#262a34] text-[#bbcabf] hover:text-[#dfe2ef]\'\n          }`}\n          type=\"button\"\n        >\n          120 min\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n};\n"
