  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Modal**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the `CancelModal.tsx` component. The design, as outlined in the HTML, calls for a modal dialog with a blurred backdrop. Inside, I plan to include a warning icon within a circle, labeled `error-container/30`. The title will be \"\302\277Liberar este turno?\" and I\'ll include the specified text.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_568746"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface CancelModalProps {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  onConfirmCancel: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CancelModal: React.FC<CancelModalProps> = ({\\n  isOpen,\\n  onClose,\\n  onConfirmCancel,\\n}) => {\\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n      aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-[#0f131c]/80 backdrop-blur-md animate-in fade-in duration-200\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-sm p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#262a34] shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-3.5 border border-[#3c4a42]\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#93000a]/30 text-[#ffb4ab] flex items-center justify-center self-center\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">warning</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"text-center flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n          <h2 className=\\\"text-[18px] text-[#dfe2ef] font-bold\\\">\\n            \302\277Liberar este turno?\\n          </h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[13px] text-[#bbcabf] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            Est\303\241s a tiempo de cancelar sin penalizaci\303\263n. La pista quedar\303\241 disponible para otros jugadores de la comunidad.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2 mt-1\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onConfirmCancel}\\n            className=\\\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#ffb4ab] text-[#690005] text-[14px] font-bold active:scale-95 transition-transform cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            S\303\255, Cancelar Turno\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onClose}\\n            className=\\\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#1c1f29] text-[#dfe2ef] hover:bg-[#353943] text-[14px] font-medium transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          >\\n            Mantener Reserva\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create CancelModal component for booking cancellation confirmation\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/CancelModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing CancelModal.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create CancelModal component\"}"
