  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Screen Architecture**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently structuring the React Native screens within `src/screens/` based on the user\'s specifications. I\'ve begun crafting `CanchasScreen.tsx`, including a greeting header, a status message, and a badge. The design will be highly modular, adhering to the user\'s architectural guidelines. Next, I\'ll tackle the layouts for screens 2, 3, and 4.\n\n\n**Defining Screen Components**\n\nI\'m now detailing the individual React Native components for screen 1. This includes the `MatchmakingBanner`, a quick filter with chips, and the `CourtCard` component. I\'m also planning the `QuickMatchDrawer`. I\'ve moved onto the specifics of screen 2, \"ReservarScreen,\" designing the calendar strip, the court selector, the duration switcher, and the time slot grid. I\'m also designing the booking summary sheet.\n\n\n**Designing Booking Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing screen 2\'s booking confirmation and associated actions. I\'ve worked out the \"Subir Comprobante de Pago,\" \"Invitar Jugadores,\" and \"Cancelar Turno\" buttons and their associated interactions. I am designing a card for confirmed and paid reservations with a badge and details. Also, the slots with confirmed players are under consideration. Finally, I\'m defining the structures of the payment and cancel modals.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_688263"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Court, CourtFilterType, UserProfile } from \'../types\';\\nimport { MatchmakingBanner } from \'../components/MatchmakingBanner\';\\nimport { CourtCard } from \'../components/CourtCard\';\\nimport { QuickMatchDrawer } from \'../components/QuickMatchDrawer\';\\n\\ninterface CanchasScreenProps {\\n  user: UserProfile;\\n  courts: Court[];\\n  onSelectCourtForBooking: (courtId: string, preselectedSlot?: string) => void;\\n  onJoinOpenMatch: () => void;\\n  onAutoSlot: () => void;\\n  isMatchJoined?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CanchasScreen: React.FC<CanchasScreenProps> = ({\\n  user,\\n  courts,\\n  onSelectCourtForBooking,\\n  onJoinOpenMatch,\\n  onAutoSlot,\\n  isMatchJoined = false,\\n}) => {\\n  const [selectedCategory, setSelectedCategory] = useState<CourtFilterType>(\'all\');\\n  const [favorites, setFavorites] = useState<Record<string, boolean>>({});\\n\\n  const filterChips: Array<{ id: CourtFilterType; label: string; countLabel?: string }> = [\\n    { id: \'all\', label: `Todas (${courts.length})` },\\n    { id: \'panoramica\', label: \'Panor\303\241mica Pro\' },\\n    { id: \'techada\', label: \'Cristal Techada\' },\\n    { id: \'exterior\', label: \'Pista Exterior\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const filteredCourts = courts.filter((court) => {\\n    if (selectedCategory === \'all\') return true;\\n    return court.category === selectedCategory;\\n  });\\n\\n  const handleToggleFavorite = (courtId: string) => {\\n    setFavorites((prev) => ({\\n      ...prev,\\n      [courtId]: !prev[courtId],\\n    }));\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"flex flex-col w-full gap-5\\\">\\n      {/* Saludo & Status Header */}\\n      <section className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1 mt-1\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-[24px] font-bold text-[#dfe2ef] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              \302\241Hola, {user.full_name.split(\' \')[0]}!{\' \'}\\n              <span className=\\\"inline-block hover:rotate-12 transition-transform cursor-default\\\">\\n                \360\237\221\213\\n              </span>\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-[14px] text-[#bbcabf]\\\">Encuentra tu pista hoy</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#262a34] shadow-md border border-[#31353f]\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"relative flex h-2 w-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#4edea3] opacity-75\\\"></span>\\n              <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#4edea3]\\\"></span>\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#4edea3] tracking-wider uppercase\\\">\\n              Sede Norte\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Dynamic Banner: Matchmaking / 4to Jugador */}\\n      <MatchmakingBanner\\n        onJoinMatch={onJoinOpenMatch}\\n        isJoined={isMatchJoined}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Horizontal Filter Chips */}\\n      <section className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#bbcabf]\\\">\\n            Tipo de Cancha\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#4edea3]\\\">\\n            {filteredCourts.length} disponibles\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-1 -mx-4 px-4 scrollbar-none\\\">\\n          {filterChips.map((chip) => {\\n            const isActive = selectedCategory === chip.id;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={chip.id}\\n                onClick={() => setSelectedCategory(chip.id)}\\n                className={`shrink-0 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer active:scale-95 ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'bg-[#4edea3] text-[#003824] shadow-sm\'\\n                    : \'bg-[#1c1f29] text-[#bbcabf] hover:text-[#dfe2ef] border border-[#31353f]/40\'\\n                }`}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              >\\n                {chip.label}\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Court Cards List */}\\n      <section className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-5\\\">\\n        {filteredCourts.map((court) => (\\n          <CourtCard\\n            key={court.id}\\n            court={court}\\n            onSelectCourt={onSelectCourtForBooking}\\n            onToggleFavorite={handleToggleFavorite}\\n            isFavorite={!!favorites[court.id]}\\n          />\\n        ))}\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Quick Match Bottom Drawer Trigger */}\\n      <QuickMatchDrawer onAutoSlot={onAutoSlot} />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create CanchasScreen component matching Screen 1\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/screens/CanchasScreen.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing CanchasScreen.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create CanchasScreen component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\341\030\n\336\030\001i\024}\023\245\351P>S\v\372\224@vc\267]\000B\3021@\237\333\253\374\313_t\222rzJ\370x\201\272Dv\214%Q7\246Mb_zRl\346v\231\376\001\337<L\314\233U\202d_9i\250.q\376\330v+L9\320\270%[\034P\2362\224\177\260\202\303\200\222\340\301\301;q\301\342\321\352\211\350\233\005\036\2351\264\212\231\261\034\366\331C\0347 5a\253\251A\263X\275\350\004\274<\262l\217\270\316\v\362w\3056\350X3\216\0274\301\305\337\220\302\375wF\334a!m\314[\277\333\360\215m5\233\037\236-F\362\347\324#\237Cw\333c\330R\374\211R\\c\027YDzme\362\322V\365c `\032\000\255\375\221KN\207a\212\314\216\\j2\351\f`\n\325\177;\245\"\245\276\020h^\361\026\337\277\361\237\327\207\270\222\"\tG\202\201\203\006\3576\347\256\226_%\313\270}\200)\023\374?05\326\330%\336\037,(\360q\2106\276\031\352\212\352s\025}B\f\243K\345\202\215\030,\004J\260U\335(x\330\r\366\225\n\017\n7\005%\243\311y\234\022\275o\fY\216\2640\023\264\276D7\313\266;V}\03745\305\354\261\255\374\026wr\005|#\265\330\320!{\236\321\244\371\266,\\\320\021\365\313:\3461\2553f-\324\215\204\323jj\336\020\315#\355\263\302\237?\246\326 \357d.\v0:\377\352&\226\370\206!\031\354\300r\361\304\\\"\3468\352\353l\032\244\224\247\177=\356\237\332\215Ns\271\3023\360\271\3027T\006\350\202Y\223\206\372\377\274.\320\221\243N\271\231\323\347\376^\372\370\263\314F\002\005\003@v\2641\027#\201\f\335\317E\312\030{\036\tj\t\360\371\255\022F\"\256N\235\262>W\000\352\a\214Rb\241\253\307\t\367\211J\250/8\211d\226\252\343>\363\250\310\321\300\004\340\334\277\273\347\3422\302\225\226\265\371\277\344\262po\362\222%\332d\254\366\230\337\035\003\353.,d.\2711\331\322\353y\331\302\276}\303\333\253^\255\225\265z\306u\266n\327P(\223\221\271\021Y\002A\332\347\217\205cC\300\367\020\312$ \313\306r`\017\270\222\212\360t\252\353\335\2372\306M\237\275\337\303\315\347\331\201\367\v\204$I\317\306\300\235\343\267\266\367\233Y\250\224\275\177\017$\370V\263Z\256E\031]A\220\353X\331\272\376\020*`b\n2O\3463\332\'+\235\375\245\345\203\021\265\207\236\313%\371