  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing App.tsx**\n\nI\'m now focused on building `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve just started considering the architecture guidelines from the prompt. It\'s clear that this file will strictly function as the router, avoiding business logic or complex data manipulation, and focusing on state management. This separation of concerns is key.\n\n\n**Defining App States**\n\nI\'m now clarifying the application states within App.tsx. I am structuring the global state to include the current view, user-related data (currentUser, isAdmin), and the data related to courts, bookings, and toast messages. This involves carefully considering types and data structures for each state variable, and establishing the key states that will be required. I also have the `selectedCourtId`, `bookings`, `courts`, `currentUser`, `isAdmin`, `toast`, and `detailBooking` states to consider.\n\n\n**Defining New States**\n\nI\'m now adding a `profileModalOpen` boolean to manage the profile modal visibility. I also need to calculate `hasPendingPayment` using the bookings data, updating the `bookings` state. Moreover, I\'m considering the functions: `onSelectCourtForBooking`, `onBookingConfirmed`, `onUploadPaymentProof`, `onCancelBooking`, `onJoinOpenMatch`, `onAutoSlot`, and `onInvitePlayers`, detailing each function and considering how their functionality impacts state updates and toast messages.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_599729"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from \'react\';\\nimport { NavView, UserProfile, Court, Booking, ToastMessage } from \'./types\';\\nimport {\\n  getStoredProfile,\\n  getStoredBookings,\\n  getStoredCourts,\\n  createBookingInDb,\\n  cancelBookingInDb,\\n  uploadPaymentProofInDb,\\n  confirmPaymentByCancheroInDb,\\n  blockCourtSlotInDb,\\n  joinOpenMatchInDb,\\n  resetUserProfileInDb,\\n  updateUserProfileInDb,\\n} from \'./apiService\';\\n\\nimport { AppHeader } from \'./components/AppHeader\';\\nimport { BottomNav } from \'./components/BottomNav\';\\nimport { ToastNotification } from \'./components/ToastNotification\';\\nimport { UserProfileModal } from \'./components/UserProfileModal\';\\nimport { MatchDetailModal } from \'./components/MatchDetailModal\';\\n\\nimport { CanchasScreen } from \'./screens/CanchasScreen\';\\nimport { ReservarScreen } from \'./screens/ReservarScreen\';\\nimport { PartidosScreen } from \'./screens/PartidosScreen\';\\nimport { ClubScreen } from \'./screens/ClubScreen\';\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  // Global View and State (App.tsx is the Router & State Coordinator)\\n  const [view, setView] = useState<NavView>(\'canchas\');\\n  const [user, setUser] = useState<UserProfile>(getStoredProfile);\\n  const [courts, setCourts] = useState<Court[]>(getStoredCourts);\\n  const [bookings, setBookings] = useState<Booking[]>(getStoredBookings);\\n  const [selectedCourtId, setSelectedCourtId] = useState<string>(\'court-1\');\\n  const [isAdminMode, setIsAdminMode] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [isMatchJoined, setIsMatchJoined] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n\\n  // Modals & Floating Components\\n  const [toast, setToast] = useState<ToastMessage | null>(null);\\n  const [isProfileModalOpen, setIsProfileModalOpen] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [detailBooking, setDetailBooking] = useState<Booking | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Sync admin mode when user role changes\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (user.role === \'club_admin\') {\\n      setIsAdminMode(true);\\n    }\\n  }, [user.role]);\\n\\n  // Toast Helper\\n  const showToast = useCallback((title: string, description: string, type: \'success\' | \'info\' | \'error\' = \'success\') => {\\n    setToast({ id: `toast-${Date.now()}`, title, description, type });\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Auto-dismiss toast\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!toast) return;\\n    const timer = setTimeout(() => {\\n      setToast(null);\\n    }, 3500);\\n    return () => clearTimeout(timer);\\n  }, [toast]);\\n\\n  // Actions passed down to components\\n  const handleNavigate = (newView: NavView) => {\\n    setView(newView);\\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSelectCourtForBooking = (courtId: string, _preselectedSlot?: string) => {\\n    setSelectedCourtId(courtId);\\n    setView(\'reservar\');\\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleBookingConfirmed = async (data: {\\n    court: Court;\\n    dateLabel: string;\\n    dateFull: string;\\n    timeSlot: string;\\n    durationMin: number;\\n    totalPrice: number;\\n    courtPrice: number;\\n    lightingPrice: number;\\n    teamNotes: string;\\n  }) => {\\n    const newBooking = await createBookingInDb({\\n      court: data.court,\\n      dateLabel: data.dateLabel,\\n      dateFull: data.dateFull,\\n      timeSlot: data.timeSlot,\\n      durationMin: data.durationMin,\\n      totalPrice: data.totalPrice,\\n      courtPrice: data.courtPrice,\\n      lightingPrice: data.lightingPrice,\\n      teamNotes: data.teamNotes,\\n      user,\\n    });\\n    setBookings((prev) => [newBooking, ...prev]);\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Pista Reservada!\', \'Se ha bloqueado tu turno en \' + data.court.name);\\n    setView(\'mis-partidos\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleUploadPaymentProof = async (bookingId: string, proofUrl?: string) => {\\n    const updated = await uploadPaymentProofInDb(bookingId, proofUrl);\\n    setBookings(updated);\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Comprobante Enviado!\', \'Estamos validando tu comprobante de pago.\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCancelBooking = async (bookingId: string) => {\\n    const updated = await cancelBookingInDb(bookingId);\\n    setBookings(updated);\\n    showToast(\'Turno Cancelado\', \'La pista qued\303\263 liberada para otros jugadores.\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleInvitePlayers = (booking: Booking) => {\\n    const shareUrl = `https://padelassist.app/match/${booking.id}`;\\n    if (navigator.clipboard) {\\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(shareUrl).catch(() => {});\\n    }\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Enlace copiado!\', \'Enlace de partido copiado al portapapeles.\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCopyBankAlias = (alias: string) => {\\n    if (navigator.clipboard) {\\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(alias).catch(() => {});\\n    }\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Alias copiado!\', `Alias ${alias} copiado al portapapeles.`);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleJoinOpenMatch = async () => {\\n    const res = await joinOpenMatchInDb(user);\\n    setIsMatchJoined(true);\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Sumado al partido!\', res.message);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleAutoSlot = () => {\\n    setSelectedCourtId(\'court-1\');\\n    setView(\'reservar\');\\n    showToast(\'Reserva Rel\303\241mpago\', \'Seleccionamos la mejor pista para hoy 18:00 hs\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleConfirmCancheroPayment = async () => {\\n    // Confirm the first pending booking if available\\n    const pending = bookings.find((b) => b.status === \'pending_payment\');\\n    if (pending) {\\n      const updated = await confirmPaymentByCancheroInDb(pending.id);\\n      setBookings(updated);\\n    }\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Pago Confirmado en Mostrador!\', \'Turno 18:00 Pista 1 marcado como Pagado.\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleBlockCourtSlot = async (courtName: string, reason: string) => {\\n    await blockCourtSlotInDb(courtName, \'18:00\', reason);\\n    showToast(\'\302\241Slot Bloqueado!\', `${courtName} congelada por: ${reason}`);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSwitchUserRole = async () => {\\n    const nextRole = user.role === \'club_admin\' ? \'customer\' : \'club_admin\';\\n    const updated = await updateUserProfileInDb({\\n      role: nextRole,\\n      full_name: nextRole === \'club_admin\' ? \'Canchero Juan\' : \'Mart\303\255n G\303\263mez\',\\n    });\\n    setUser(updated);\\n    setIsAdminMode(nextRole === \'club_admin\');\\n    showToast(\\n      \'Rol Actualizado\',\\n      `Ahora est\303\241s en modo ${nextRole === \'club_admin\' ? \'Canchero Admin\' : \'Jugador\'}`\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleResetData = async () => {\\n    const reset = await resetUserProfileInDb();\\n    setUser(reset);\\n    setCourts(getStoredCourts());\\n    setBookings(getStoredBookings());\\n    setIsAdminMode(false);\\n    setIsMatchJoined(false);\\n    showToast(\'Datos Reiniciados\', \'La aplicaci\303\263n volvi\303\263 a su estado inicial de demostraci\303\263n.\');\\n  };\\n\\n  const hasPending = bookings.some((b) => b.status === \'pending_payment\');\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-[#0f131c] text-[#dfe2ef] min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-[#10b981] selection:text-[#00422b]\\\">\\n      {/* Dynamic Toast Notification */}\\n      <ToastNotification\\n        toast={toast}\\n        onClose={() => setToast(null)}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Global App Header */}\\n      <AppHeader\\n        user={user}\\n        onOpenProfile={() => setIsProfileModalOpen(true)}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Main View Router Content */}\\n      <main className=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col w-full max-w-lg mx-auto px-4 pt-20 pb-28\\\">\\n        {view === \'canchas\' && (\\n          <CanchasScreen\\n            user={user}\\n            courts={courts}\\n            onSelectCourtForBooking={handleSelectCourtForBooking}\\n            onJoinOpenMatch={handleJoinOpenMatch}\\n            onAutoSlot={handleAutoSlot}\\n            isMatchJoined={isMatchJoined}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n\\n        {view === \'reservar\' && (\\n          <ReservarScreen\\n            user={user}\\n            courts={courts}\\n            selectedCourtId={selectedCourtId}\\n            onCourtChange={(courtId) => setSelectedCourtId(courtId)}\\n            onBookingConfirmed={handleBookingConfirmed}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n\\n        {view === \'mis-partidos\' && (\\n          <PartidosScreen\\n            bookings={bookings}\\n            onUploadPaymentProof={handleUploadPaymentProof}\\n            onCancelBooking={handleCancelBooking}\\n            onInvitePlayers={handleInvitePlayers}\\n            onCopyBankAlias={handleCopyBankAlias}\\n            onViewBookingDetails={(b) => setDetailBooking(b)}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n\\n        {view === \'club-info\' && (\\n          <ClubScreen\\n            isAdminMode={isAdminMode}\\n            onToggleAdminMode={(admin) => setIsAdminMode(admin)}\\n            onConfirmCancheroPayment={handleConfirmCancheroPayment}\\n            onBlockCourtSlot={handleBlockCourtSlot}\\n            onShowToast={showToast}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n      </main>\\n\\n      {/* Profile & Role Management Modal */}\\n      <UserProfileModal\\n        isOpen={isProfileModalOpen}\\n        user={user}\\n        onClose={() => setIsProfileModalOpen(false)}\\n        onSwitchRole={handleSwitchUserRole}\\n        onResetDb={handleResetData}\\n        onShowToast={showToast}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Booking Details Modal */}\\n      <MatchDetailModal\\n        booking={detailBooking}\\n        onClose={() => setDetailBooking(null)}\\n        onInvite={handleInvitePlayers}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Bottom Navigation Bar */}\\n      <BottomNav\\n        currentView={view}\\n        onNavigate={handleNavigate}\\n        hasPendingPayment={hasPending}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement complete App.tsx acting cleanly as the Router and State Coordinator\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing App.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Implement router and state coordinator in App.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\354\036\n\351\036\001i\024}\023\306\022\236\343\003\bP\377\300\2069\214c\261\022Z\353m\276\321\206\377\375\002\277Ep\302\036\275\334\364b\336T)\004\356\302\222O\357#a\330\fun\031\270V\350\343\036\254\351v+\255\006\213wl\221\311\236\310\2528\200^\214gT\006\001\252\340\177\225\340\271*\331\274\024\343\272\031\016\037T\313\034\216\033\254\377D\306dx\0010\320L\274\300\347\326\211\275\263hC\036\3022\023\322si\331\'\206K?\300\313\341\245\240\001\317?\005\356\3404Q,\270\320\306/\370l`\232\224\274\370\205\0021n\275\306F\375\254&0\n\273\357\303\337\366\2518\n+\256\372\"\333P\273h\f2\201\223\n\2221~%\214@\330\257e\206[\221\004w\003\215\037-\"\302\247\233\21600T\374\366\aoZ\264W\262\232\0014a\227\005R\fAgP\027u\017F^\326\366\307W)53\320\265\b6\2320D/x\230\255\270O\310.=p,\203\204o\360\275\245\267\te\302\274\202\264\204Qa\357B\257\234p\340sv\2450E:N\r\261\271\331\n\377\361v\376Ez>[\231\273\037%\337+#\376l\246?\001\255\034Ke\f\a\215\a+\032st\303/\313(\016\033\253T\324\311\033{\211 \244E\\><\300-\204_\324\346\312TO\026\001\330\247\311\371\244\313\220\207\311Bb\027\036\262F\202jL;\367\323\224\"\370\211\354\322\201\234@\037H,\032\001\247&\177\364\367\245\031~\326\304\331\037j\026\006=\351`p\301\260i\200\253\\\006\241!?=Pz\223\202E\214\246\316\240\333F\036j\310\350\374\323:\006\203y\236.\226\225\342\324qRm\332\324\003L\004\220\204\3323dh-\306Nd\240X\352\215\315\236\vZ\232C7Y4\346\327\254P>\261\006\211\226Ld\253\335\211G\316y*\030B\002\307+m\220\312\033\256\277\261\027\325u5\362\226\3762U\204\004\005x4\314fg\022A\276]\346\213\312\026W\3007a\027\023]\024[\264\031\2251\371\261\260P\252y\227\203\254\246v\264\242\330\305:\005.\033\fa\342\3475\034\221G`\243X\215hJ\0250N\025.\366\213@\214\244Mo:Y\367\004s\236Z\rL3+0\331\016\242\367\321f\211N\374\344\230\301G]4B\034\261\215X\372o\030\234\230\371HH2\245\210+\277\351\333\231\340U\201,\361\277L\331\357\274\21008\3050!\220\023\353s\312\003\333)\3214Nm\206\354\364\242xo\334\214\331\020\a\212\263V34\252\2359\005$F`