    thinking: "**Examining RLS Policies**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of Row Level Security (RLS) policies. My focus is on the `profiles` and `courts` tables. Specifically, I\'m noting the use of `auth.uid() = id` for user-specific access control within the `profiles` table, enabling users to view and update their own profiles. I\'m moving on to the `courts` table to determine access control.\n\n\n**Analyzing Access Control Rules**\n\nI\'ve just finalized my examination of the RLS policies, focusing particularly on the `bookings` table. I\'ve noted the \'Public read courts\' and \'Public read amenities\' rules. I\'m taking special care with the `bookings` table to clarify the privacy rules. Crucially, customers should only see blocked time in the public view, not the details of the booking user. I\'m now structuring the exact SQL schema, including these RLS policies, into `src/db/schema.sql`. I\'ll next turn to implementing RLS in `src/apiService.ts`.\n\n\n**Defining Booking Retrieval Logic**\n\nI\'m now detailing the logic for `fetchBookingsWithRLS()`. As a club admin, I should retrieve all booking data, including sensitive information. Customers, however, can only retrieve their own bookings. Publicly, booked time slots must only show as reserved, concealing customer details. I\'m carefully implementing the privacy requirements. The `createBookingInDb` function enforces user authentication and sets `user_id`, and `updateUserProfileInDb` enforces user authentication as well.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_411233"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"-- ====================================================================\\n-- PADEL ASSIST PRO - POSTGRESQL / SUPABASE DATABASE SCHEMA & RLS RULES\\n-- ====================================================================\\n\\n-- 1. TIPOS Y ENUMS\\nCREATE TYPE user_role AS ENUM (\'customer\', \'club_admin\', \'superadmin\');\\nCREATE TYPE booking_status AS ENUM (\'pending_payment\', \'confirmed\', \'cancelled\', \'completed\');\\n\\n-- 2. PERFILES DE USUARIO (Complemento de auth.users)\\nCREATE TABLE profiles (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    full_name TEXT NOT NULL,\\n    phone TEXT NOT NULL,\\n    avatar_url TEXT,\\n    role user_role DEFAULT \'customer\',\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 3. CANCHAS E INFRAESTRUCTURA\\nCREATE TABLE courts (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    name TEXT NOT NULL, -- ej: \\\"Cancha 1 (Panor\303\241mica)\\\"\\n    type TEXT NOT NULL, -- \\\"Cristal Techada\\\", \\\"Malla Descubierta\\\"\\n    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE,\\n    hourly_rate NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,\\n    photos TEXT[] DEFAULT \'{}\',\\n    description TEXT,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 4. CAT\303\201LOGO DE SERVICIOS ADICIONALES (Cafeter\303\255a, Alquiler de palas, Tienda)\\nCREATE TABLE amenities_catalog (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    title TEXT NOT NULL, -- ej: \\\"Pala Bullpadel Pro\\\", \\\"Gatorade 500ml\\\", \\\"Duchas y Vestuarios\\\"\\n    category TEXT NOT NULL, -- \'alquiler\', \'tienda\', \'servicio_gratis\'\\n    price NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,\\n    is_available BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE,\\n    image_url TEXT\\n);\\n\\n-- 5. RESERVAS DE CANCHAS\\nCREATE TABLE bookings (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    court_id UUID REFERENCES courts(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT,\\n    user_id UUID REFERENCES profiles(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n    guest_name TEXT, -- Por si el club la anota manualmente para alguien sin app\\n    guest_phone TEXT,\\n    start_time TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,\\n    end_time TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,\\n    total_price NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,\\n    status booking_status DEFAULT \'pending_payment\',\\n    payment_proof_url TEXT,\\n    notes TEXT,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),\\n    \\n    -- Evita solapamiento de horarios exactos en la misma cancha\\n    CONSTRAINT check_booking_duration CHECK (end_time > start_time)\\n);\\n\\n-- \303\215ndice para acelerar la consulta de disponibilidad horaria\\nCREATE INDEX idx_bookings_court_time ON bookings (court_id, start_time, end_time);\\n\\n-- ====================================================================\\n-- ROW LEVEL SECURITY (RLS) POLICIES\\n-- ====================================================================\\n\\n-- Habilitar RLS en tablas cr\303\255ticas\\nALTER TABLE profiles ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE bookings ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE courts ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE amenities_catalog ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\n\\n-- REGLAS PROFILES:\\n-- Cada usuario solo edita y lee su perfil; el administrador del club ve los perfiles de sus clientes\\nCREATE POLICY \\\"Users can view own profile\\\" \\nON profiles FOR SELECT USING (auth.uid() = id);\\n\\nCREATE POLICY \\\"Users can update own profile\\\" \\nON profiles FOR UPDATE USING (auth.uid() = id);\\n\\n-- REGLAS COURTS & CATALOG:\\n-- Cualquiera (incluso sin login) puede ver canchas y cat\303\241logo para incentivar la visita\\nCREATE POLICY \\\"Public read courts\\\" \\nON courts FOR SELECT USING (is_active = TRUE);\\n\\nCREATE POLICY \\\"Public read amenities\\\" \\nON amenities_catalog FOR SELECT USING (is_available = TRUE);\\n\\n-- REGLAS BOOKINGS (Crucial para privacidad):\\n-- Los clientes solo ven el horario bloqueado en la vista p\303\272blica, pero NO los datos de qui\303\251n reserv\303\263\\nCREATE POLICY \\\"Customers view own booking details\\\" \\nON bookings FOR SELECT \\nUSING (\\n    auth.uid() = user_id \\n    OR \\n    EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM profiles WHERE profiles.id = auth.uid() AND profiles.role = \'club_admin\')\\n);\\n\\n-- Inserci\303\263n de reserva: Usuarios autenticados\\nCREATE POLICY \\\"Authenticated users can create bookings\\\" \\nON bookings FOR INSERT \\nWITH CHECK (auth.uid() = user_id);\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create database schema and RLS policies SQL definition\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/db/schema.sql\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing schema.sql\", \"toolSummary\":\"Save SQL schema and RLS policies\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\204\033\n\201\033\001i\024}\023[\f\375\277(\263\263\372\245\256\360\361\345\235 \177\265\002\267R\v\260\232.\023u\247\344;=\367i\226\343N\277[\3234\244*\307q\243\266yQ\333\031\"\001I\246q+w\230-\271\034\243\213\276\t\356\375\362\332B\036\024\265\363hQ\225D]z\304Wy\242 \230\221\310\v\244\214l\311\270|G/ \255\317\220\333\262\306\005\032/M\257\260,\017\2446Q\252gv\271\332\370\353*\363\341\b\037\210 #\333]<\367k\2559\316y\265-\353g\230\320\364No\311\022-e\v\304X\004\374%\206\311\374\006!\243\224\367R\372\210\322\222\326\031\307\002\363\270\340\210\001i\271O\325&H\355K\331\313\271j\313\371]1\'ZT\3345n^ts0`\022\224s\225\223\242\324\003\311\312\313u\242\317f\tk\220\215\311U\315y#\321\345\344\246\023\263GJ\035\311xO\177\355\233Q\376\241\232\327\274\360\340\2501\344\035\244\374\t\016O\367@\210G\251\314\322m\324\235\347Z\240\020\a)\206\325\t\300u\035t\b\305l\316(\261\325Fx\n,\312iU[\365\235\202\241\230\330\355\034\234\231+\342\254\033\210\243\227\263\325\004#\234\234\356\263\270\3623\246\312\316\034\264\375\253b\305\341K\331]\311\215\245T\3274\\\347\217\334*\317m\234m\227\333\005I\230+\236\205?\246\345\261l\253\272\a\200\373\261=\237\261\030\371B\313bZ\023\331\340\277\266\\\"\001$eh\353V\252\320\261\026\342\177P=\3632Ck\225n\304\346\311\304\020\317f\267\023\312\266`\025\357\302;\031\310\001\325\231\361\311R\2120>29\030\024M\252p\355\226e\337\232\271\314#r\n\256\177\267\246\\\264\213s\265\212\241\242\034\335\373\334n+\035\205:]\233Y\266\220V)\200\304\324^\266\372Z{8X\242\373\330\206\\\177{3\vF\231\210O\031f5\243J\aI\270*\033~\370\276\0315qO\330yoz\033\370\'\207\004ud\350:\332n\237%out\225x\032;.\260d3\211z\0319\264\374\350\bdK\002\250\331;\246\252[\343\a\332\275*\342V\275\'\323\264_\2750\344\272z0\032Ug\363\200\n\251\370I1\270\003YA\017\226[\373~\266\226#B\306\315\274\361?\nH\177A.\313\326$\304\244\366\235\265\220v\214\275(k\274\3128\226\265\023\022\321\024\377\240\275P\222\345\213\000\370/\260\366H\031\b28\225\352\376\312\262\b,\004\261\256\311