\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Add RLS Security Status Card to UserProfileModal\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing UserProfileModal.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update UserProfileModal with RLS info\"}"
